The '''Sea Guardian ''' was a {{Rarity|c|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creatures|Sea Creature]] that could be fished up from any source of [[Water]] after reaching {{skill|Fishing|5}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Sea Guardians''' could be fished up from Water anywhere. 

== Weight ==
The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Sea Guardian''' was {{Green|600}}. Certain modifiers was used to increase it:
